<title>UK: Sal Oppenheim sets 100 mln mark step-up bond.</title>
<headline>Sal Oppenheim sets 100 mln mark step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Sal Oppenheim.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SAL OPPENHEIM</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON   **4.0	 MATURITY    07.MAR.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    07.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  UNDISC    LISTING    DUES	PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> NOTES    **IN YEAR ONE, 5.0 PCT YEAR TWO, 6.0 PCT YEAR THREE,</p>
<p>		8.0 PCT YEAR FOUR, 10 PCT YEAR FIVE.</p>
<p>		EACH 1,000 MARK DENOMINATION PAYABLE IN 1,000 MARKS</p>
<p>		OR $590 AT ISSUERS OPTION (ANNOUNCED 21.FEB.02)</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (K) ONE	 YIELD	 6.41 PCT</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
